        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </dl>

  <h2>Calculate Your Net Salary</h2>
  <p>Want to see how these terms affect your pay in practice? Use our <a href="/en/">salary calculator</a> to calculate your net salary after Norwegian tax. You can also use our <a href="/netto-til-brutto/">net-to-gross calculator</a> to calculate backwards from your desired net salary.</p>
</GuideLayout>
